    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ages ago, Dexcalibur, the skateboard of legend, was sealed away- taking with it the Kingdom's hope. Today, an unlikely traveler may have the key to unlocking the board's potential, reuniting the Lands of Steeze, and doing the Impossible. Are you up to the task, Squire? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face fearsome foes, gain unlikely allies, and hit sick combos in this story-driven skateboarding adventure in the Lands of Steeze. Explore locations such as snowy Trickendell, the blistering Hawkish Underground, and sleepy Granite Grove on your quest to reassemble Dexcalibur and reunite the Kingdom. </p>",
